  "description": "🍁🧸 Celebrate the coziest moments of autumn with this warm watercolor clipart collection featuring seasonal treats, comforting drinks, woodland treasures, cozy clothing, books, and charming fall essentials. Painted in a modern commercial watercolor style with simplified organic shapes, soft painterly textures, and rich autumn colors, each illustration captures the feeling of crisp afternoons, homemade desserts, warm sweaters, and peaceful reading without a vintage or rustic look.\n✨ Perfect for:\n• Print on Demand products\n• Stickers and sticker sheets\n• Scrapbooking projects\n• Journals and planners\n• Greeting cards and bookmarks\n• Invitations and stationery\n• Social media graphics\n• Seasonal home décor designs\n• Digital and printable crafts\n• Cozy autumn and fall projects\n🧡 What’s included:\n– 19 high-quality illustrations\n– Transparent background\n– High resolution – 300 DPI (perfect for print & digital use)\n– 19 PNG files (transparent background)\n– 19 SVG files\n🍂 Included illustrations:\nraspberry jam jar, bread with butter and raspberry jam, cinnamon bundle, cookie jar, teddy bear in a cable knit sweater, bear knit sweater, acorn trio, pumpkin trio, autumn maple tree, vinyl record with decorative sleeve, cinnamon rolls, cozy sweater stack, brown velvet bow, knit socks, pumpkin spice latte to-go, ceramic leaf mug, autumn book stack, hazelnut chocolate pieces, apple pie slice etc.\n🍁 Inspired by cozy fall mornings, warm cafés, homemade baking, autumn reading sessions, pumpkin season, woodland walks, soft knitwear, comforting desserts, cinnamon aromas, slow living, seasonal home décor, crisp weather, and peaceful evenings. These illustrations are perfect for creating warm, inviting seasonal designs with a modern cozy autumn aesthetic.",
  "fullDescription": "<p>🍁🧸 Celebrate the coziest moments of autumn with this warm watercolor clipart collection featuring seasonal treats, comforting drinks, woodland treasures, cozy clothing, books, and charming fall essentials. Painted in a modern commercial watercolor style with simplified organic shapes, soft painterly textures, and rich autumn colors, each illustration captures the feeling of crisp afternoons, homemade desserts, warm sweaters, and peaceful reading without a vintage or rustic look.</p>\n<p>✨ Perfect for:<br>\n• Print on Demand products<br>\n• Stickers and sticker sheets<br>\n• Scrapbooking projects<br>\n• Journals and planners<br>\n• Greeting cards and bookmarks<br>\n• Invitations and stationery<br>\n• Social media graphics<br>\n• Seasonal home décor designs<br>\n• Digital and printable crafts<br>\n• Cozy autumn and fall projects</p>\n<p>🧡 What’s included:<br>\n– 19 high-quality illustrations<br>\n– Transparent background<br>\n– High resolution – 300 DPI (perfect for print &amp; digital use)<br>\n– 19 PNG files (transparent background)<br>\n– 19 SVG files</p>\n<p>🍂 Included illustrations:</p>\n<p>raspberry jam jar, bread with butter and raspberry jam, cinnamon bundle, cookie jar, teddy bear in a cable knit sweater, bear knit sweater, acorn trio, pumpkin trio, autumn maple tree, vinyl record with decorative sleeve, cinnamon rolls, cozy sweater stack, brown velvet bow, knit socks, pumpkin spice latte to-go, ceramic leaf mug, autumn book stack, hazelnut chocolate pieces, apple pie slice etc.</p>\n<p>🍁 Inspired by cozy fall mornings, warm cafés, homemade baking, autumn reading sessions, pumpkin season, woodland walks, soft knitwear, comforting desserts, cinnamon aromas, slow living, seasonal home décor, crisp weather, and peaceful evenings. These illustrations are perfect for creating warm, inviting seasonal designs with a modern cozy autumn aesthetic.</p>",
